<title>HONG KONG: Strong quake recorded on Iran-Turkmenistan border.</title>
<headline>Strong quake recorded on Iran-Turkmenistan border.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>A severe earthquake estimated to measure 6.9 on the Richter scale was recorded about 562 kms (350 miles) east-northeast of Tehran at 6.47 p.m. Hong Kong time (1047 GMT) on Tuesday, Hong Kong's Royal Observatory said.  </p>
<p>The epicentre was initially determined to be in the Turkmenistan-Iran border region at 37.4 degrees north 57.4 degrees east.</p>
